<title>UK: GKN appoints Sarah Hogg as non-exec director.</title>
<headline>GKN appoints Sarah Hogg as non-exec director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auto-components giant GKN Plc on Monday appointed Baroness Hogg as a non-executive director.</p>
<p>Sarah Hogg was head of the Downing Street (Prime Minister's) Policy Unit from 1990 to 1995 and has been economics editor of the Economist, Times, Sunday Times and Daily Telegraph.</p>
<p>She is currently chairman-designate of London Economics, an independent economics consultancy. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
</text>
